    "body": "Hermicity checks fail for hamiltonians using x and y for spinless fermions\n\n**To Reproduce**\n```\nfrom quspin.operators import hamiltonian\nfrom quspin.basis import spinless_fermion_basis_general\n\nbasis = spinless_fermion_basis_general(N=2)\n\nstatic = [[\"xy\", [[1j, 0, 1]]]]\n\nquspin_ham = hamiltonian(static, [], basis=basis,)\n```\n\nThis returns\n\n`TypeError: Hamiltonian not hermitian! To turn this check off set check_herm=False in hamiltonian.`",
